--- !u!114 &970969223798394017
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 9084631425712276253}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 100b2a012864b784ab958e209168dc9f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  interactIndicator: {fileID: 3903345416983043744}
  animator: {fileID: 6266553527203394977}
  firstDialogue:
    name: Gerald
    sentences:
    - Ghu...
    - "How did you end up here young man ? I would have helped you get out of here
      but, you see, my leg is broken.\t"
    - The only thing I can tell you is that you have to find a way to open this metal
      trap door behind you.
    - I hope this will help you.
    - Don't worry about me, I've been stuck here for thirty years. I no longer have
      my place in this world.
    - 'But I still have a soul to save. You probably think I''m crazy but...

      you
      are definitely right...'
  isThereASecondDialogue: 1
  secondDialogue:
    name: Gerald
    sentences:
    - Haven't I already spoken to you ?
    - It's not important. I just have to repeat myself. I would have helped you get
      out of here but, you see, my leg is broken.
    - The only thing I can tell you is that you have to find a way to open this metal
      trap door behind you.
    - I hope this will help you.
    - Don't worry about me, I've been stuck here for thirty years. I no longer have
      my place in this world.
    - 'But I still have a soul to save. You probably think I''m crazy but...

      you
      are definitely right...'
  isThereASpecialDialogue: 0
  specialDialogue:
    name: Gerald
    sentences:
    - Oh... I see...
    - You managed to move this trapdoor. Congratulations.
    - You can go now. I hope you will find your way.
